1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:09,317
It was this: after one hundred and thirty-eight days of silence, Jung AH-hyun was singing again — and this time, officially, in the center.

2
00:00:09,317 --> 00:00:11,829
The arrangements suddenly made sense.

3
00:00:11,829 --> 00:00:14,265
The seven-part harmonies had their seventh.

4
00:00:14,265 --> 00:00:17,564
Choreographers stopped designing around empty air.

5
00:00:17,564 --> 00:00:23,427
For the first time since January 2023, BABYMONSTER was mathematically complete.

